    "summary": "In the world of traditional Indian sweets, few treats can spark as much joy and nostalgia as a perfectly crafted Bundhi Bliss. A favorite across Telangana and Andhra Pradesh, this delicate sweet is more than just a dessert; it’s an experience that brings families together, lights up festivals, and creates memories that last a lifetime.",
